Maintainer: Thomas Grainger <tagrain@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), grub-efi-amd64-bin [amd64], grub-efi-arm64-bin [arm64], dpkg-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: efibootnext
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, efibootmgr, grub-common, grub2-common
Description: Reboot to Windows via EFI BootNext (BitLocker-safe)
 Adds a GRUB menu entry that reboots into Windows (or other EFI OS)
 by setting the EFI BootNext variable via a GRUB module, avoiding
 the need to change the default GRUB entry or risk breaking BitLocker
 by chainloading the Windows bootloader directly.
